when someone sends "/start" or "menu", reply "What do you want to know?" with buttons "Prices", "Hours" and "Contact".

when someone sends "prices", reply "Coffee 900 tenge, tea 600 tenge.".
when someone sends "hours", reply "We are open every day from 9:00 to 21:00.".
when someone sends "contact", reply "Call us: +7 700 000 00 00.".

when someone sends a message that contains "coffee" or "кофе", reply "Coffee is 900 tenge. Come by!".
when someone sends anything else, reply "Press one of the buttons." with buttons "Prices", "Hours" and "Contact".
